Error [E0740]: `read_only` uses the effect `Fs.Write`, which its signature doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/effect_tree_sibling_rejected.jet:12:31
    |
 12 | fn read_only(path: String) --[Fs.Read]-> {
    |                               ^^^^^^^
 Why: the signature declares `--[Fs.Read]->`, so the body may only use those; `Fs.Write` is outside that set
 Fix: add `Fs.Write` to the effect list, or stop using it in `read_only`
